#. Description of the plugin
#: allpay-gateway.php
msgid "Allpay payment gateway for WooCommerce to accepts Visa, Mastercard, Diners, AmEx and other brands, and Apple Pay and Bit."
msgstr "שער התשלומים Allpay ל־WooCommerce תומך בכרטיסי Visa, Mastercard, Diners, American Express ומותגים נוספים, וכן Apple Pay ו-Bit."

